                                "sense_id": "35412e6b-392a-37d6-94dc-a6a260d4ce36",
                                "text": "1978, Matter of Green, 586 F. 2d 1247 - U.S. Court of Appeals, 8th Circuit\nAssuming arguendo that those assertions are factually true, we find respondent's claim to be without legal merit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bcdaccc-1c83-45c3-84f9-5b9298359bf0",
                                "sense_id": "35412e6b-392a-37d6-94dc-a6a260d4ce36",
                                "text": "Grant me, arguendo, that sort of scenario, with the Soviet federation rebuilding and small wars raging here and there, as the world of the millennium."
                            }
                        ]
